  "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>Pursuit Snake</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🐍</text></svg>\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles/main.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"game-container\">\n    <canvas id=\"game-canvas\"></canvas>\n    <div id=\"hud\">\n      <div id=\"score\">SCORE: 00000</div>\n      <div id=\"timer\">TIME: 00:00.00</div>\n      <div id=\"high-score\">HI: 00000</div>\n      <div id=\"stats\">LAG: 0.60 | SPD: 3.20</div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"pause-overlay\" class=\"overlay hidden\">\n      <div class=\"modal\">\n        <h2>PAUSED</h2>\n        <div class=\"menu\" id=\"pause-menu\">\n          <button data-action=\"resume\">Resume</button>\n          <button data-action=\"restart\">Restart</button>\n          <button data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button>\n          <button data-action=\"quit\">Main Menu</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"settings-overlay\" class=\"overlay hidden\">\n      <div class=\"modal\">\n        <h2>SETTINGS</h2>\n        <div class=\"menu\">\n          <div class=\"setting\">\n            <label>Pursuit Lag: <span id=\"lag-value\">0.60</span></label>\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"lag-slider\" min=\"0.4\" max=\"0.8\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.6\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"setting\">\n            <label>Speed Multiplier</label>\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"speed-mult\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"setting\">\n            <label>Color Theme</label>\n            <div class=\"theme-buttons\">\n              <button data-theme=\"cyber\" class=\"active\">Cyber Neon</button>\n              <button data-theme=\"mono\">Minimal Mono</button>\n              <button data-theme=\"pastel\">Pastel</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"setting\">\n            <button id=\"reset-highscore\">Reset High Score</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"setting\">\n            <label>Volume: <span id=\"volume-value\">50</span>%</label>\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"volume-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"50\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"buttons\">\n            <button id=\"save-settings\">Save</button>\n            <button id=\"cancel-settings\">Cancel</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"gameover-overlay\" class=\"overlay hidden\">\n      <div class=\"modal\">\n        <h2>GAME OVER</h2>\n        <div id=\"final-score\">Score: 0</div>\n        <div id=\"high-score-compare\">High Score: 0</div>\n        <div class=\"menu\">\n          <button data-action=\"play-again\">Play Again</button>\n          <button data-action=\"main-menu\">Main Menu</button>\n          <button data-action=\"share\">Share Score</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"start-overlay\" class=\"overlay\">\n      <div class=\"modal\">\n        <h1>PURSUIT SNAKE</h1>\n        <p>Guide the snake. The tail chases the head with physics.</p>\n        <div class=\"menu\">\n          <button id=\"start-btn\">Start Game</button>\n          <button id=\"settings-btn\">Settings</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- On-screen controls for mobile -->\n    <div id=\"touch-controls\" class=\"hidden\">\n      <div id=\"joystick\">\n        <div id=\"stick\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"pause-btn\">⏸</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"src/main.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "styles/main.css": ":root {\n  --bg: #111;\n  --fg: #eee;\n  --accent: #0ff;\n  --accent-dim: #088;\n  --head: #0ff;\n  --tail: #088;\n  --food: #f0f;\n  --overlay: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);\n  --btn-bg: #222;\n  --btn-hover: #333;\n  --btn-text: #eee;\n  --btn-border: #0ff;\n  --font-main: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;\n}\n[data-theme=\"cyber\"] {\n  --bg: #0a0a1a;\n  --fg: #e0e0ff;\n  --accent: #00ffff;\n  --accent-dim: #008888;\n  --head: #00ffff;\n  --tail: #004488;\n  --food: #ff00ff;\n  --overlay: rgba(10,10,30,0.9);\n  --btn-bg: #111133;\n  --btn-hover: #222255;\n  --btn-text: #00ffff;\n  --btn-border: #00ffff;\n}\n[data-theme=\"mono\"] {\n  --bg: #000;\n  --fg: #fff;\n  --accent: #fff;\n  --accent-dim: #888;\n  --head: #fff;\n  --tail: #666;\n  --food: #fff;\n  --overlay: rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\n  --btn-bg: #111;\n  --btn-hover: #333;\n  --btn-text: #fff;\n  --btn-border: #fff;\n}\n[data-theme=\"pastel\"] {\n  --bg: #fef6fb;\n  --fg: #332233;\n  --accent: #ff6ec7;\n  --accent-dim: #c85aa0;\n  --head: #ff6ec7;\n  --tail: #a855a8;\n  --food: #6ec7ff;\n  --overlay: rgba(254,246,251,0.95);\n  --btn-bg: #ffe0f0;\n  --btn-hover: #ffcce0;\n  --btn-text: #332233;\n  --btn-border: #ff6ec7;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nhtml, body { height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-main); }\n#game-container { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }\n#game-canvas { display: block; max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; touch-action: none; }\n#hud { position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 10px; right: 10px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; pointer-events: none; z-index: 10; }\n#hud > div { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold; text-shadow: 0 0 4px #000, 0 0 8px var(--accent); }\n#score { color: var(--head); }\n#high-score { color: var(--accent); }\n#timer { color: var(--fg); }\n#stats { position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 0.9rem; background: var(--overlay); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--btn-border); }\n.overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--overlay); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; z-index: 20; }\n.overlay.hidden { display: none; }\n.modal { background: var(--bg); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--btn-border); box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--accent-dim); text-align: center; max-width: 90%; width: 400px; }\n.modal h1, .modal h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--accent); text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent); }\n.menu { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem; }\nbutton { background: var(--btn-bg); color: var(--btn-text); border: 2px solid var(--btn-border); padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; font-family: inherit; }\nbutton:hover, button:focus { background: var(--btn-hover); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent); outline: none; }\nbutton:active { transform: scale(0.98); }\n.setting { margin: 1rem 0; text-align: left; }\n.setting label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; font-size: 1rem; }\n.setting input[type=range] { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--accent); }\n.setting input[type=checkbox] { width: 1.2rem; height: 1.2rem; accent-color: var(--accent); }\n.theme-buttons { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }\n.theme-buttons button { flex: 1; min-width: 80px; }\n.theme-buttons button.active { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent); }\n.buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; margin-top: 1rem; }\n.buttons button { flex: 1; max-width: 150px; }\n#touch-controls { position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 20px; right: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; padding: 10px; z-index: 15; }\n#joystick { width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 3px solid var(--btn-border); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--overlay); position: relative; touch-action: none; }\n#stick { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); transition: transform 0.1s; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent); }\n#pause-btn { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 1.5rem; background: var(--btn-bg); border: 2px solid var(--btn-border); color: var(--btn-text); }\n@media (min-width: 768px) { #touch-controls { display: none !important; } }\n@media (max-width: 767px) { #touch-controls.hidden { display: none; } #touch-controls { display: flex; } }\n/* Focus visible for accessibility */\nbutton:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }\n/* High contrast mode */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) { :root { --overlay: rgba(0,0,0,0.95); --btn-border: #ff0; --accent: #ff0; --head: #ff0; --tail: #cc0; --food: #f0f; } }",
  "config/settings.js": "export const CONFIG = {\n  canvas: { width: 800, height: 600 },\n  snake: {\n    initialSegments: 3,\n    maxSegments: 20,\n    segmentSize: 20,\n    pursuitLag: { default: 0.6, min: 0.4, max: 0.8, step: 0.01 },\n    headColor: 'var(--head)',\n    tailColor: 'var(--tail)',\n  },\n  physics: {\n    vMax: 4.0,\n    acceleration: 0.15,\n    friction: 0.98,\n    turnRate: 0.08, // radians per frame at 60fps\n  },\n  food: {\n    baseScore: 10,\n    size: 16,\n    pulseSpeed: 0.05,\n  },\n  level: {\n    scorePerLevel: 200,\n    speedIncreasePer100: 0.02,\n    lagDecreasePerLevel: 0.05,\n    maxSegmentsIncreasePerLevel: 1,\n  },\n  powerUps: {\n    spawnChance: 0.002, // per frame\n    types: [\n      { id: 'lag-drop', name: 'Lag Drop', color: '#0ff', duration: 5000, effect: { lagMult: 0.5 } },\n      { id: 'speed-surge', name: 'Speed Surge', color: '#f0f', duration: 5000, effect: { speedMult: 1.3 } },\n      { id: 'segment-slice', name: 'Segment Slice', color: '#ff0', duration: 0, effect: { segments: -2, score: 50 } },\n    ],\n  },\n  audio: {\n    masterVolume: 0.5,\n    enabled: true,\n  },\n  storageKeys: {\n    highScore: 'pursuitSnake_highScore',\n    pursuitLag: 'pursuitSnake_pursuitLag',\n    theme: 'pursuitSnake_theme',\n    volume: 'pursuitSnake_volume',\n    speedMult: 'pursuitSnake_speedMult',\n  },\n  themes: ['cyber', 'mono', 'pastel'],\n  defaultTheme: 'cyber',\n};\n\nexport function loadSettings() {\n  const saved = {},\n    keys = CONFIG.storageKeys;\n  try {\n    saved.highScore = parseInt(localStorage.getItem(keys.highScore)) || 0;\n    saved.pursuitLag = parseFloat(localStorage.getItem(keys.pursuitLag)) || CONFIG.snake.pursuitLag.default;\n    saved.theme = localStorage.getItem(keys.theme) || CONFIG.defaultTheme;\n    saved.volume = parseInt(localStorage.getItem(keys.volume)) || 50;\n    saved.speedMult = localStorage.getItem(keys.speedMult) === 'true';\n  } catch (e) { console.warn('localStorage unavailable', e); }\n  return saved;\n}\n\nexport function saveSettings(settings) {\n  const keys = CONFIG.storageKeys;\n  try {\n    if (settings.highScore !== undefined) localStorage.setItem(keys.highScore, settings.highScore);\n    if (settings.pursuitLag !== undefined) localStorage.setItem(keys.pursuitLag, settings.pursuitLag);\n    if (settings.theme !== undefined) localStorage.setItem(keys.theme, settings.theme);\n    if (settings.volume !== undefined) localStorage.setItem(keys.volume, settings.volume);\n    if (settings.speedMult !== undefined) localStorage.setItem(keys.speedMult, settings.speedMult);\n  } catch (e) { console.warn('localStorage save failed', e); }\n}",
  "src/engine.js": "import { CONFIG } from '../config/settings.js';\n\nexport class Engine {\n  constructor(canvas) {\n    this.canvas = canvas;\n    this.ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    this.resize();\n    window.addEventListener('resize', () => this.resize());\n    this.lastTime = 0;\n    this.running = false;\n    this.paused = false;\n    this.game = null; // will be set by main\n  }\n\n  resize() {\n    const container = this.canvas.parentElement;\n    const maxWidth = container.clientWidth;\n    const maxHeight = container.clientHeight;\n    const aspect = CONFIG.canvas.width / CONFIG.canvas.height;\n    let w = maxWidth;\n    let h = maxWidth / aspect;\n    if (h > maxHeight) {\n      h = maxHeight;\n      w = maxHeight * aspect;\n    }\n    this.canvas.width = CONFIG.canvas.width;\n    this.canvas.height = CONFIG.canvas.height;\n    this.canvas.style.width = `${w}px`;\n    this.canvas.style.height = `${h}px`;\n    this.scaleX = w / CONFIG.canvas.width;\n    this.scaleY = h / CONFIG.canvas.height;\n  }\n\n  start(game) {\n    this.game = game;\n    this.running = true;\n    this.lastTime = performance.now();\n    requestAnimationFrame(this.loop.bind(this));\n  }\n\n  stop() {\n    this.running = false;\n  }\n\n  togglePause() {\n    this.paused = !this.paused;\n    if (!this.paused) {\n      this.lastTime = performance.now();\n      requestAnimationFrame(this.loop.bind(this));\n    }\n  }\n\n  loop(timestamp) {\n    if (!this.running) return;\n    if (this.paused) return;\n    const dt = (timestamp - this.lastTime) / 1000; // seconds\n    this.lastTime = timestamp;\n    // clamp dt to avoid huge jumps\n    const clampedDt = Math.min(dt, 1/30);\n    this.game.update(clampedDt);\n    this.render();\n    requestAnimationFrame(this.loop.bind(this));\n  }\n\n  render() {\n    const ctx = this.ctx;\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, CONFIG.canvas.width, CONFIG.canvas.height);\n    // draw background gradient\n    const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, CONFIG.canvas.width, CONFIG.canvas.height);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--bg').trim());\n    grad.addColorStop(1, '#000');\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, CONFIG.canvas.width, CONFIG.canvas.height);\n    if (this.game) this.game.render(ctx);\n  }\n\n  // convert screen coordinates to canvas coordinates\n  screenToCanvas(clientX, clientY) {\n    const rect = this.canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    return {\n      x: (clientX - rect.left) / this.scaleX,\n      y: (clientY - rect.top) / this.scaleY,\n    };\n  }\n}",
  "src/input.js": "export class Input {\n  constructor(engine) {\n    this.engine = engine;\n    this.keys = {};\n    this.lastDirection = { x: 1, y: 0 };\n    this.touchStart = null;\n    this.joystickActive = false;\n    this.joystickCenter = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n    this.setupKeyboard();\n    this.setupTouch();\n  }\n\n  setupKeyboard() {\n    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n      this.keys[e.code] = true;\n      // prevent default for arrow keys and space\n      if (['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','Space','KeyW','KeyA','KeyS','KeyD','Escape'].includes(e.code)) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n      }\n    });\n    window.addEventListener('keyup', (e) => {\n      this.keys[e.code] = false;\n    });\n  }\n\n  setupTouch() {\n    const joystick = document.getElementById('joystick');\n    const stick = document.getElementById('stick');\n    const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pause-btn');\n    if (!joystick) return; // no touch controls on desktop\n    \n    joystick.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const touch = e.touches[0];\n      const rect = joystick.getBoundingClientRect();\n      this.joystickCenter = { x: rect.left + rect.width/2, y: rect.top + rect.height/2 };\n      this.touchStart = { x: touch.clientX, y: touch.clientY };\n      this.joystickActive = true;\n      this.updateStick(touch.clientX, touch.clientY, stick, joystick);\n    }, { passive: false });\n    \n    window.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {\n      if (!this.joystickActive) return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const touch = e.touches[0];\n      this.updateStick(touch.clientX, touch.clientY, stick, joystick);\n    }, { passive: false });\n    \n    window.addEventListener('touchend', () => {\n      this.joystickActive = false;\n      this.touchStart = null;\n      stick.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%)';\n    });\n    \n    pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      this.engine.togglePause();\n    });\n  }\n\n  updateStick(clientX, clientY, stick, joystick) {\n    const dx = clientX - this.joystickCenter.x;\n    const dy = clientY - this.joystickCenter.y;\n    const dist = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n    const maxDist = joystick.offsetWidth / 2 - stick.offsetWidth / 2;\n    let nx = dx, ny = dy;\n    if (dist > maxDist) {\n      nx = dx / dist * maxDist;\n      ny = dy / dist * maxDist;\n    }\n    stick.style.transform = `translate(calc(-50% + ${nx}px), calc(-50% + ${ny}px))`;\n    // normalize to -1..1\n    this.lastDirection = { x: nx / maxDist, y: ny / maxDist };\n  }\n\n  getDirection() {\n    // keyboard\n    let dir = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n    if (this.keys['ArrowUp'] || this.keys['KeyW']) dir.y = -1;\n    if (this.keys['ArrowDown'] || this.keys['KeyS']) dir.y = 1;\n    if (this.keys['ArrowLeft'] || this.keys['KeyA']) dir.x = -1;\n    if (this.keys['ArrowRight'] || this.keys['KeyD']) dir.x = 1;\n    \n    // if keyboard input, use it (override touch)\n    if (dir.x !== 0 || dir.y !== 0) {\n      const len = Math.hypot(dir.x, dir.y);\n      this.lastDirection = { x: dir.x/len, y: dir.y/len };\n      return this.lastDirection;\n    }\n    // otherwise use touch joystick\n    return this.lastDirection;\n  }\n\n  isPausePressed() {\n    return this.keys['Escape'] || this.keys['KeyP'];\n  }\n\n  consumePause() {\n    this.keys['Escape'] = false;\n    this.keys['KeyP'] = false;\n  }\n}",
  "src/physics.js": "import { CONFIG } from '../config/settings.js';\n\nexport class Physics {\n  constructor() {\n    this.vMax = CONFIG.physics.vMax;\n    this.acceleration = CONFIG.physics.acceleration;\n    this.friction = CONFIG.physics.friction;\n    this.turnRate = CONFIG.physics.turnRate;\n    this.pursuitLag = CONFIG.snake.pursuitLag.default;\n    this.speedMultiplier = 1.0;\n  }\n\n  setPursuitLag(lag) {\n    this.pursuitLag = Math.max(CONFIG.snake.pursuitLag.min, Math.min(CONFIG.snake.pursuitLag.max, lag));\n  }\n\n  setSpeedMultiplier(enabled) {\n    this.speedMultiplier = enabled ? 1.3 : 1.0;\n  }\n\n  updateHead(head, inputDir, dt) {\n    // inputDir is normalized desired direction\n    if (inputDir.x !== 0 || inputDir.y !== 0) {\n      const desiredAngle = Math.atan2(inputDir.y, inputDir.x);\n      let angleDiff = desiredAngle - head.angle;\n      // normalize to -PI..PI\n      while (angleDiff > Math.PI) angleDiff -= 2*Math.PI;\n      while (angleDiff < -Math.PI) angleDiff += 2*Math.PI;\n      const maxTurn = this.turnRate * (dt * 60); // scale by 60fps reference\n      if (Math.abs(angleDiff) > maxTurn) {\n        angleDiff = Math.sign(angleDiff) * maxTurn;\n      }\n      head.angle += angleDiff;\n    }\n    // accelerate in current heading\n    const accel = this.acceleration * this.speedMultiplier * (dt * 60);\n    head.vx += Math.cos(head.angle) * accel;\n    head.vy += Math.sin(head.angle) * accel;\n    // apply friction\n    head.vx *= this.friction;\n    head.vy *= this.friction;\n    // clamp speed\n    const speed = Math.hypot(head.vx, head.vy);\n    const maxSpeed = this.vMax * this.speedMultiplier;\n    if (speed > maxSpeed) {\n      head.vx = head.vx / speed * maxSpeed;\n      head.vy = head.vy / speed * maxSpeed;\n    }\n    // update position\n    head.x += head.vx * (dt * 60);\n    head.y += head.vy * (dt * 60);\n  }\n\n  updateSegments(segments, headPos) {\n    // segments[0] follows head, segments[1] follows segments[0], etc.\n    let prev = headPos;\n    for (const seg of segments) {\n      // lerp toward previous segment position\n      seg.x += (prev.x - seg.x) * this.pursuitLag;\n      seg.y += (prev.y - seg.y) * this.pursuitLag;\n      prev = seg;\n    }\n  }\n\n  checkCollision(head, segments, canvasWidth, canvasHeight, segmentSize) {\n    // wall collision\n    const half = segmentSize / 2;\n    if (head.x < half || head.x > canvasWidth - half || head.y < half || head.y > canvasHeight - half) {\n      return true;\n    }\n    // self collision (head with any segment)\n    for (const seg of segments) {\n      const dx = head.x - seg.x;\n      const dy = head.y - seg.y;\n      if (dx*dx + dy*dy < segmentSize * segmentSize * 0.8) { // slightly smaller than segmentSize\n        return true;\n      }\n    }\n    return false;\n  }\n}",
  "src/game.js": "import { CONFIG } from '../config/settings.js';\nimport { Physics } from './physics.js';\nimport { ParticleSystem } from './particles.js';\nimport { Audio } from './audio.js';\n\nconst { canvas, snake, food, level, powerUps, storageKeys } = CONFIG;\n\nexport class Game {\n  constructor(engine, input, ui, audio) {\n    this.engine = engine;\n    this.input = input;\n    this.ui = ui;\n    this.audio = audio;\n    this.physics = new Physics();\n    this.particles = new ParticleSystem();\n    this.reset();\n    // load settings\n    this.loadSettings();\n  }\n\n  loadSettings() {\n    const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('pursuitSnake_settings') || '{}');\n    if (saved.pursuitLag) this.physics.setPursuitLag(saved.pursuitLag);\n    if (saved.speedMult !== undefined) this.physics.setSpeedMultiplier(saved.speedMult);\n    if (saved.volume !== undefined) this.audio.setVolume(saved.volume / 100);\n    this.highScore = saved.highScore || 0;\n    this.ui.updateHighScore(this.highScore);\n  }\n\n  saveSettings() {\n    const settings = {\n      pursuitLag: this.physics.pursuitLag,\n      speedMult: this.physics.speedMultiplier > 1.0,\n      volume: this.audio.volume * 100,\n      highScore: this.highScore,\n    };\n    localStorage.setItem('pursuitSnake_settings', JSON.stringify(settings));\n  }\n\n  reset() {\n    this.head = {\n      x: canvas.width / 2,\n      y: canvas.height / 2,\n      vx: 0,\n      vy: 0,\n      angle: 0,\n    };\n    this.segments = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < snake.initialSegments; i++) {\n      this.segments.push({ x: this.head.x, y: this.head.y });\n    }\n    this.score = 0;\n   this.level = 1;\n    this.levelProgress = 0;\n    this.food = null;\n    this.powerUp = null;\n    this.gameOver = false;\n    this.paused = false;\n    this.startTime = performance.now();\n    this.lastPowerUpSpawn = 0;\n    this.ui.updateScore(0);\n    this.ui.updateTimer(0);\n    this.ui.updateStats(this.physics.pursuitLag, this.physics.speedMultiplier);\n    this.spawnFood();\n  }\n\n  spawnFood() {\n    const padding = snake.segmentSize;\n    this.food = {\n      x: padding + Math.random() * (canvas.width - 2 * padding),\n      y: padding + Math.random() * (canvas.height - 2 * padding),\n      pulse: 0,\n    };\n  }\n\n  maybeSpawnPowerUp() {\n    if (this.powerUp) return;\n    if (Math.random() < powerUps.spawnChance) {\n      const type = powerUps.types[Math.floor(Math.random() * powerUps.types.length)];\n      const padding = snake.segmentSize;\n      this.powerUp = {\n        x: padding + Math.random() * (canvas.width - 2 * padding),\n        y: padding + Math.random() * (canvas.height - 2 * padding),\n        type,\n        pulse: 0,\n        spawnTime: performance.now(),\n      };\n    }\n  }\n\n  update(dt) {\n    if (this.gameOver || this.paused) return;\n    \n    const inputDir = this.input.getDirection();\n    this.physics.updateHead(this.head, inputDir, dt);\n    this.physics.updateSegments(this.segments, this.head);\n    \n    // check food collision\n    const headRadius = snake.segmentSize / 2;\n    const foodRadius = food.size / 2;\n    const dx = this.head.x - this.food.x;\n    const dy = this.head.y - this.food.y;\n    if (dx*dx + dy*dy < (headRadius + foodRadius) ** 2) {\n      this.eatFood();\n    }\n    \n    // check powerup collision\n    if (this.powerUp) {\n      const pdx = this.head.x - this.powerUp.x;\n      const pdy = this.head.y - this.powerUp.y;\n      if (pdx*pdx + pdy*pdy < (headRadius + foodRadius) ** 2) {\n        this.collectPowerUp();\n      }\n      // powerup expires after 10 seconds\n      if (performance.now() - this.powerUp.spawnTime > 10000) {\n        this.powerUp = null;\n      }\n    }\n    \n    // collision detection\n    if (this.physics.checkCollision(this.head, this.segments, canvas.width, canvas.height, snake.segmentSize)) {\n      this.endGame();\n      return;\n    }\n    \n    // update particles\n    this.particles.update(dt);\n    \n    // update timer\n    const elapsed = (performance.now() - this.startTime) / 1000;\n    this.ui.updateTimer(elapsed);\n    \n    // maybe spawn powerup\n    this.maybeSpawnPowerUp();\n    \n    // update food pulse\n    this.food.pulse += food.pulseSpeed * dt * 60;\n    if (this.powerUp) this.powerUp.pulse += food.pulseSpeed * dt * 60;\n  }\n\n  eatFood() {\n    this.score += food.baseScore * this.level;\n    this.levelProgress += food.baseScore * this.level;\n    this.ui.updateScore(this.score);\n    this.audio.play('eat');\n    this.particles.emit(this.food.x, this.food.y, food.color || '#f0f', 8);\n    \n    // grow snake\n    const lastSeg = this.segments[this.segments.length - 1] || this.head;\n    this.segments.push({ x: lastSeg.x, y: lastSeg.y });\n    \n    // level up check\n    if (this.levelProgress >= level.scorePerLevel) {\n      this.levelUp();\n    }\n    \n    this.spawnFood();\n  }\n\n  collectPowerUp() {\n    const { type, effect } = this.powerUp;\n    this.audio.play('powerup');\n    this.particles.emit(this.powerUp.x, this.powerUp.y, type.color, 15);\n    \n    if (effect.lagMult) {\n      this.physics.pursuitLag *= effect.lagMult;\n      setTimeout(() => this.physics.pursuitLag /= effect.lagMult, type.duration);\n    }\n    if (effect.speedMult) {\n      this.physics.speedMultiplier *= effect.speedMult;\n      setTimeout(() => this.physics.speedMultiplier /= effect.speedMult, type.duration);\n    }\n    if (effect.segments) {\n      const count = Math.abs(effect.segments);\n      for (let i = 0; i < count && this.segments.length > snake.initialSegments; i++) {\n        this.segments.pop();\n      }\n      this.score += effect.score || 0;\n      this.ui.updateScore(this.score);\n    }\n    \n    this.powerUp = null;\n    this.ui.updateStats(this.physics.pursuitLag, this.physics.speedMultiplier);\n  }\n\n  levelUp() {\n    this.level++;\n    this.levelProgress = 0;\n    this.physics.vMax += level.speedIncreasePer100 * 100;\n    this.physics.pursuitLag = Math.max(CONFIG.snake.pursuitLag.min, this.physics.pursuitLag - level.lagDecreasePerLevel);\n    CONFIG.snake.maxSegments += level.maxSegmentsIncreasePerLevel;\n    this.audio.play('levelup');\n    this.particles.emit(canvas.width/2, canvas.height/2, '#0ff', 30);\n    this.ui.updateStats(this.physics.pursuitLag, this.physics.speedMultiplier);\n  }\n\n  endGame() {\n    this.gameOver = true;\n    this.audio.play('gameover');\n    this.particles.emit(this.head.x, this.head.y, '#f00', 20);\n    \n    if (this.score > this.highScore) {\n      this.highScore = this.score;\n      this.saveSettings();\n    }\n    \n    const elapsed = (performance.now() - this.startTime) / 1000;\n    this.ui.showGameOver(this.score, this.highScore, elapsed);\n  }\n\n  render(ctx) {\n    // draw segments (tail to head)\n    for (let i = this.segments.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      const seg = this.segments[i];\n      const t = i / Math.max(1, this.segments.length - 1);\n      const color = this.lerpColor(snake.tailColor, snake.headColor, t);\n      ctx.fillStyle = color;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(seg.x, seg.y, snake.segmentSize / 2 * (0.8 + 0.2 * t), 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fill();\n      // glow\n      ctx.shadowColor = color;\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 10;\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n    }\n    \n    // draw head\n    ctx.fillStyle = snake.headColor;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(this.head.x, this.head.y, snake.segmentSize / 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.shadowColor = snake.headColor;\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 15;\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n    \n    // draw eyes on head\n    const eyeOffset = snake.segmentSize / 4;\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#000';\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(this.head.x + Math.cos(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset - Math.sin(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset, \n            this.head.y + Math.sin(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset + Math.cos(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset, \n            3, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.arc(this.head.x + Math.cos(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset + Math.sin(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset, \n            this.head.y + Math.sin(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset - Math.cos(this.head.angle) * eyeOffset, \n            3, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.fill();\n    \n    // draw food\n    const pulseScale = 1 + 0.15 * Math.sin(this.food.pulse);\n    ctx.fillStyle = food.color || '#f0f';\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(this.food.x, this.food.y, food.size / 2 * pulseScale, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.shadowColor = food.color || '#f0f';\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 15 * pulseScale;\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n    \n    // draw powerup\n    if (this.powerUp) {\n      const ppulse = 1 + 0.2 * Math.sin(this.powerUp.pulse);\n      ctx.fillStyle = this.powerUp.type.color;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      // diamond shape\n      const s = food.size / 2 * ppulse;\n      ctx.moveTo(this.powerUp.x, this.powerUp.y - s);\n      ctx.lineTo(this.powerUp.x + s, this.powerUp.y);\n      ctx.lineTo(this.powerUp.x, this.powerUp.y + s);\n      ctx.lineTo(this.powerUp.x - s, this.powerUp.y);\n      ctx.closePath();\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.shadowColor = this.powerUp.type.color;\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 15;\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n    }\n    \n    // draw particles\n    this.particles.render(ctx);\n  }\n\n  lerpColor(a, b, t) {\n    // simple CSS color interpolation (assumes hex or rgb)\n    // for simplicity, return a or b based on t\n    return t > 0.5 ? b : a;\n  }\n\n  setPursuitLag(lag) {\n    this.physics.setPursuitLag(lag);\n    this.ui.updateStats(this.physics.pursuitLag, this.physics.speedMultiplier);\n  }\n\n  setSpeedMultiplier(enabled) {\n    this.physics.setSpeedMultiplier(enabled);\n    this.ui.updateStats(this.physics.pursuitLag, this.physics.speedMultiplier);\n  }\n\n  setTheme(theme) {\n    document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\n    this.saveSettings();\n  }\n\n  setVolume(vol) {\n    this.audio.setVolume(vol);\n    this.saveSettings();\n  }\n\n  togglePause() {\n    this.paused = !this.paused;\n    this.engine.togglePause();\n    this.ui.togglePauseOverlay(this.paused);\n  }\n}",
  "src/particles.js": "export class ParticleSystem {\n  constructor() {\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  emit(x, y, color, count = 10) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n      const speed = 1 + Math.random() * 3;\n      this.particles.push({\n        x,\n        y,\n        vx: Math.cos(angle) * speed,\n        vy: Math.sin(angle) * speed,\n        life: 1.0,\n        decay: 0.015 + Math.random() * 0.02,\n        size: 2 + Math.random() * 4,\n        color,\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  update(dt) {\n    const frames = dt * 60;\n    for (let i = this.particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      const p = this.particles[i];\n      p.x += p.vx * frames;\n      p.y += p.vy * frames;\n      p.vx *= 0.98;\n      p.vy *= 0.98;\n      p.life -= p.decay * frames;\n      if (p.life <= 0) {\n        this.particles.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  render(ctx) {\n    for (const p of this.particles) {\n      ctx.globalAlpha = p.life;\n      ctx.fillStyle = p.color;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.size * p.life, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fill();\n    }\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 1.0;\n  }\n}",
  "src/audio.js": "export class Audio {\n  constructor() {\n    this.ctx = null;\n    this.volume = 0.5;\n    this.enabled = true;\n    this.sounds = {};\n    this.init();\n  }\n\n  init() {\n    try {\n      this.ctx = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();\n      // create simple synthesized sounds\n      this.createSounds();\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('Web Audio API not supported', e);\n      this.enabled = false;\n    }\n  }\n\n  createSounds() {\n    // eat sound - short blip\n    this.sounds.eat = () => this.playTone(880, 0.1, 'square', 0.3);\n    // powerup - ascending arpeggio\n    this.sounds.powerup = () => {\n      this.playTone(523, 0.1, 'sine', 0.4);\n      setTimeout(() => this.playTone(659, 0.1, 'sine', 0.4), 50);\n      setTimeout(() => this.playTone(784, 0.1, 'sine', 0.4), 100);\n      setTimeout(() => this.playTone(1047, 0.1, 'sine', 0.4), 150);\n    };\n    // level up - fanfare\n    this.sounds.levelup = () => {\n      const notes = [523, 659, 784, 1047, 1319];\n      notes.forEach((f, i) => setTimeout(() => this.playTone(f, 0.2, 'triangle', 0.3), i * 80));\n    };\n    // game over - descending\n    this.sounds.gameover = () => {\n      const notes = [523, 494, 440, 392, 349, 330];\n      notes.forEach((f, i) => setTimeout(() => this.playTone(f, 0.3, 'sawtooth', 0.2), i * 120));\n    };\n    // move - very subtle tick\n    this.sounds.move = () => this.playTone(2000, 0.02, 'sine', 0.05);\n  }\n\n  playTone(freq, duration, type = 'sine', gain = 0.1) {\n    if (!this.enabled || !this.ctx) return;\n    if (this.ctx.state === 'suspended') this.ctx.resume();\n    \n    const osc = this.ctx.createOscillator();\n    const gainNode = this.ctx.createGain();\n    osc.type = type;\n    osc.frequency.value = freq;\n    gainNode.gain.value = gain * this.volume;\n    gainNode.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, this.ctx.currentTime + duration);\n    osc.connect(gainNode);\n    gainNode.connect(this.ctx.destination);\n    osc.start();\n    osc.stop(this.ctx.currentTime + duration);\n  }\n\n  play(name) {\n    if (this.sounds[name]) this.sounds[name]();\n  }\n\n  setVolume(vol) {\n    this.volume = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, vol));\n  }\n\n  toggle() {\n    this.enabled = !this.enabled;\n  }\n}",
  "src/ui.js": "export class UI {\n  constructor() {\n    this.scoreEl = document.getElementById('score');\n    this.timerEl = document.getElementById('timer');\n    this.highScoreEl = document.getElementById('high-score');\n    this.statsEl = document.getElementById('stats');\n    this.lagSlider = document.getElementById('lag-slider');\n    this.lagValue = document.getElementById('lag-value');\n    this.speedMultCheckbox = document.getElementById('speed-mult');\n    this.volumeSlider = document.getElementById('volume-slider');\n    this.volumeValue = document.getElementById('volume-value');\n    this.themeButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.theme-buttons button');\n    \n    this.pauseOverlay = document.getElementById('pause-overlay');\n    this.settingsOverlay = document.getElementById('settings-overlay');\n    this.gameOverOverlay = document.getElementById('gameover-overlay');\n    this.startOverlay = document.getElementById('start-overlay');\n    this.touchControls = document.getElementById('touch-controls');\n    \n    this.finalScoreEl = document.getElementById('final-score');\n    this.highScoreCompareEl = document.getElementById('high-score-compare');\n    \n    this.bindSettingsUI();\n  }\n\n  bindSettingsUI() {\n    this.lagSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n      this.lagValue.textContent = parseFloat(e.target.value).toFixed(2);\n    });\n    this.volumeSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n      this.volumeValue.textContent = e.target.value;\n    });\n    this.themeButtons.forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        this.themeButtons.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n        btn.classList.add('active');\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  updateScore(score) {\n    this.scoreEl.textContent = `SCORE: ${score.toString().padStart(5, '0')}`;\n  }\n\n  updateHighScore(high) {\n    this.highScoreEl.textContent = `HI: ${high.toString().padStart(5, '0')}`;\n  }\n\n  updateTimer(seconds) {\n    const mins = Math.floor(seconds / 60);\n    const secs = Math.floor(seconds % 60);\n    const ms = Math.floor((seconds % 1) * 100);\n    this.timerEl.textContent = `TIME: ${mins.toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${secs.toString().padStart(2, '0')}.${ms.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;\n  }\n\n  updateStats(lag, speedMult) {\n    this.statsEl.textContent = `LAG: ${lag.toFixed(2)} | SPD: ${speedMult.toFixed(2)}`;\n  }\n\n  showStartScreen() {\n    this.startOverlay.classList.remove('hidden');\n    this.pauseOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n    this.settingsOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n    this.gameOverOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n    this.touchControls.classList.add('hidden');\n  }\n\n  hideStartScreen() {\n    this.startOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n    this.touchControls.classList.remove('hidden');\n  }\n\n  togglePauseOverlay(show) {\n    if (show) this.pauseOverlay.classList.remove('hidden');\n    else this.pauseOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n  }\n\n  showSettings() {\n    this.settingsOverlay.classList.remove('hidden');\n  }\n\n  hideSettings() {\n    this.settingsOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n  }\n\n  showGameOver(score, highScore, time) {\n    this.finalScoreEl.textContent = `Score: ${score}`;\n    this.highScoreCompareEl.textContent = `High Score: ${highScore}`;\n    this.gameOverOverlay.classList.remove('hidden');\n    this.touchControls.classList.add('hidden');\n  }\n\n  hideGameOver() {\n    this.gameOverOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n  }\n\n  getSettingsValues() {\n    return {\n      pursuitLag: parseFloat(this.lagSlider.value),\n      speedMult: this.speedMultCheckbox.checked,\n      volume: parseInt(this.volumeSlider.value),\n      theme: document.querySelector('.theme-buttons button.active')?.dataset.theme || 'cyber',\n    };\n  }\n\n  applySettings(values) {\n    this.lagSlider.value = values.pursuitLag;\n    this.lagValue.textContent = values.pursuitLag.toFixed(2);\n    this.speedMultCheckbox.checked = values.speedMult;\n    this.volumeSlider.value = values.volume;\n    this.volumeValue.textContent = values.volume;\n    this.themeButtons.forEach(btn => {\n      btn.classList.toggle('active', btn.dataset.theme === values.theme);\n    });\n  }\n}",
  "src/main.js": "import { Engine } from './engine.js';\nimport { Input } from './input.js';\nimport { Game } from './game.js';\import { UI } from './ui.js';\nimport { Audio } from './audio.js';\nimport { CONFIG, loadSettings, saveSettings } from '../config/settings.js';\n\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('game-canvas');\nconst engine = new Engine(canvas);\nconst input = new Input(engine);\nconst audio = new Audio();\nconst ui = new UI();\nconst game = new Game(engine, input, ui, audio);\n\n// apply loaded settings\nconst saved = loadSettings();\nif (saved.theme) {\n  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', saved.theme);\n  ui.applySettings({ ...saved, theme: saved.theme });\n}\nif (saved.pursuitLag) game.setPursuitLag(saved.pursuitLag);\nif (saved.speedMult !== undefined) game.setSpeedMultiplier(saved.speedMult);\nif (saved.volume !== undefined) audio.setVolume(saved.volume / 100);\n\n// UI event listeners\ndocument.getElementById('start-btn').addEventListener('click', startGame);\ndocument.getElementById('settings-btn').addEventListener('click', () => ui.showSettings());\n\n// pause menu\ndocument.querySelectorAll('#pause-menu button').forEach(btn => {\n  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const action = btn.dataset.action;\n    switch (action) {\n      case 'resume': game.togglePause(); break;\n      case 'restart': restartGame(); break;\n      case 'settings': ui.showSettings(); game.togglePause(); break;\n      case 'quit': returnToMenu(); break;\n    }\n  });\n});\n\n// settings overlay\ndocument.getElementById('save-settings').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const values = ui.getSettingsValues();\n  game.setPursuitLag(values.pursuitLag);\n  game.setSpeedMultiplier(values.speedMult);\n  game.setTheme(values.theme);\n  game.setVolume(values.volume / 100);\n  saveSettings(values);\n  ui.hideSettings();\n});\ndocument.getElementById('cancel-settings').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  ui.hideSettings();\n  // restore previous values\n  ui.applySettings({\n    pursuitLag: game.physics.pursuitLag,\n    speedMult: game.physics.speedMultiplier > 1.0,\n    volume: audio.volume * 100,\n    theme: document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-theme') || 'cyber',\n  });\n});\ndocument.getElementById('reset-highscore').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  if (confirm('Reset high score?')) {\n    game.highScore = 0;\n    game.saveSettings();\n    ui.updateHighScore(0);\n  }\n});\n\n// game over menu\ndocument.querySelectorAll('#gameover-overlay button').forEach(btn => {\n  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const action = btn.dataset.action;\n    switch (action) {\n      case 'play-again': restartGame(); break;\n      case 'main-menu': returnToMenu(); break;\n      case 'share': shareScore(); break;\n    }\n  });\n});\n\nfunction startGame() {\n  ui.hideStartScreen();\n  game.reset();\n  engine.start(game);\n}\n\nfunction restartGame() {\n  ui.hideGameOver();\n  ui.togglePauseOverlay(false);\n  game.reset();\n  engine.start(game);\n}\n\nfunction returnToMenu() {\n  engine.stop();\n  game.reset();\n  ui.showStartScreen();\n}\n\nfunction shareScore() {\n  const text = `I scored ${game.score} in Pursuit Snake! 🐍`;\n  if (navigator.share) {\n    navigator.share({ title: 'Pursuit Snake', text });\n  } else {\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => alert('Score copied to clipboard!'));\n  }\n}\n\n// global pause handler\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (input.isPausePressed()) {\n    input.consumePause();\n    if (!ui.startOverlay.classList.contains('hidden')) return;\n    if (!ui.gameOverOverlay.classList.contains('hidden')) return;\n    game.togglePause();\n  }\n});\n\n// handle visibility change\ndocument.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {\n  if (document.hidden && !game.paused && !game.gameOver) {\n    game.togglePause();\n  }\n});\n\n// initial state\nui.showStartScreen();\n\n// expose for debugging\nwindow.__game = game;\nwindow.__engine = engine;\nwindow.__ui = ui;\n",
  "README.md": "# Pursuit Snake\n\nA modern Snake variant where the tail physically pursues the head with configurable lag, creating a unique \"rope physics\" feel.\n\n## Features\n- **Physics-based movement**: Head accelerates and turns smoothly; tail segments follow with configurable pursuit lag\n- **Progressive difficulty**: Speed increases, lag decreases, max segments grow per level\n- **Power-ups**: Lag Drop, Speed Surge, Segment Slice\n- **Three themes**: Cyber Neon, Minimal Mono, Pastel\n- **Mobile-friendly**: Virtual joystick + pause button\n- **Persistent settings**: High score, lag, theme, volume, speed multiplier saved to localStorage\n- **Accessibility**: Keyboard navigation, focus visible, high contrast mode support\n- **Web Audio API**: Synthesized sound effects (no external assets)\n- **Particle effects**: Canvas-based visual feedback\n\n## Controls\n- **Desktop**: Arrow keys / WASD to steer, Escape/P to pause\n- **Mobile**: On-screen joystick + pause button\n\n## Settings\n- **Pursuit Lag** (0.4–0.8): How aggressively tail chases head. Lower = tighter, higher = more rope-like\n- **Speed Multiplier**: 1.3× speed boost toggle\n- **Color Theme**: Cyber Neon / Minimal Mono / Pastel\n- **Volume**: Master volume 0–100%\n\n## Development\nbash\n# Serve locally (ES modules require HTTP)\nnpx serve .\n# or\npython -m http.server 8000\n\n\n## Architecture\n- `index.html` — structure, overlays, HUD\n- `styles/main.css` — theming via CSS custom properties, responsive layout\n- `config/settings.js` — all tunable constants, localStorage helpers\n- `src/engine.js` — render loop, canvas sizing, pause/resume\n- `src/input.js` — keyboard + touch joystick, direction normalization\n- `src/physics.js` — head acceleration/turning, segment pursuit lerp, collision\n- `src/game.js` — game state, spawning, level progression, power-ups\n- `src/particles.js` — simple particle emitter for juice\n- `src/audio.js` — Web Audio API synthesized SFX\n- `src/ui.js` — DOM overlays, HUD updates, settings binding\n- `src/main.js` — wiring, event listeners, game flow\n\n## License\nMIT\n"
